{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[null],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"content":1,"content_html":1,"data":2,"slug":41},"",{"title":3,"seo":4,"content_blocks":9},"International Trademark Services",{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7,"no_index":8},"International Trademark Services | Registration, Monitoring & Enforcement | The Trademark Factory","We offer International Trademark Registration, Search and Portfolio Management. File your international trademark today","/upload/ttmf-default-seo.png",false,[10,18,29,37],{"_bookshop_name":11,"title":12,"subtitle":13,"background":14},"headers/heroDefault","International Trademarks","Your global trademark experts",{"animation":15,"image":16,"alt":17,"align_bottom":8},"services","/upload/img-hero-services.svg",null,{"_bookshop_name":19,"title":20,"content":21,"button":22,"media":25},"cards/twoCols","\u003Cp>\u003Cem>International\u003C/em> Trademark Registration\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>Did you know that trademark registration is jurisdictional, meaning \u003Cstrong>trademarks must be registered in each and every country where you want to use it?&nbsp;\u003C/strong>When you expand your business to overseas markets, safeguarding your brand in those regions becomes crucial.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Australia is a member of the Madrid Protocol which is an international trademark registration system allowing you to register your brand in up to 115 countries under a single application.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>This streamlined approach eliminates the need for filing trademark applications in each country separately making it more cost effective and efficient.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>If your target market is not covered by the Madrid Protocol, no problem! Our \u003Cstrong>network of trusted international IP lawyers\u003C/strong> can assist us to register your trademark no matter where you want to take your business.\u003C/p>",{"title_button":23,"url":24,"title":1},"Enquire about international trade marks","mailto:admin@ttmf.com.au?subject=I%20would%20like%20to%20know%20more%20about%20international%20trade%20mark%20registration&body=Thank%20you%20for%20getting%20in%20touch%20with%20us%20about%20your%20international%20trade%20mark%20registration%20enquiry.%20So%20we%20can%20contact%20you%2C%20please%20confirm%3A%0A%0A1.%20What%20country%20you%20are%20located%20in%3F%0A%0A2.%20Whether%20you%20have%20an%20existing%20Australian%20or%20New%20Zealand%20trade%20mark%20already%3F%20%0A%0A3..%20If%20yes%2C%20what%20is%20the%20trade%20mark%20number%3F%20%0A%0A3.%20If%20no%2C%20please%20provide%20us%20with%20a%20list%20of%20the%20countries%20you%20require%20protection%20for%20your%20trade%20mark%3A%20%0A%0A4.%20Please%20provide%20us%20with%20some%20information%20about%20your%20business%20and%20the%20products%20or%20services%20you%20provide%3A%20%0A%0A5.%20What%20is%20your%20full%20name%3F%0A%0A6.%20If%20you%20are%20contacting%20us%20from%20a%20company%2C%20what%20is%20the%20company%20name%3F%3A%0A%0A7.%20Please%20provide%20your%20telephone%20number%3A%20%0A%0AOnce%20we%20know%20a%20little%20more%20about%20you%2C%20one%20of%20our%20lawyers%20will%20contact%20you%20to%20discuss%20how%20we%20can%20help.",{"content":17,"image":26,"image_alt":27,"image_right":28,"align_center":28},"/upload/img-international-trademark.svg","Register your trademark internationally",true,{"_bookshop_name":30,"title":31,"content":32,"button":33},"cta/ctaDefault","International Trademark \u003Cem>Portfolio\u003C/em> Management ","\u003Cp>Do you have an \u003Cstrong>existing international trademark portfolio\u003C/strong>? Are you concerned that you may miss deadlines and risk losing your rights? If so, The TradeMark Factory has a custom in-house trade mark database so management of your trademark portfolio for both Australian and international trademarks is a breeze.\u003C/p>\u003Cp> Let us take care of your international trademark portfolio so you will \u003Cstrong>never miss a deadline\u003C/strong>.\u003C/p>",{"title_button":34,"url":35,"title":36},"Let us manage your portfolio","mailto:admin@ttmf.com.au?subject=The%20TradeMark%20Factory%20-%20TradeMark%20Portfolio%20Management%20Services&body=Hi%2C%0A%0AThank%20you%20for%20getting%20in%20touch%20with%20us%20about%20your%20trade%20mark%20portfolio.%20The%20TradeMark%20Factory%20has%20a%20custom%20built%20in-house%20trade%20mark%20database%20to%20allow%20us%20to%20manage%20and%20maintain%20our%20client's%20Australian%20and%20international%20trade%20mark%20portfolios.%20%0A%0AIf%20you%20would%20like%20us%20to%20look%20after%20your%20trade%20mark%20portfolio%2C%20please%20confirm%20the%20owner%20name%20of%20the%20trade%20marks.%20We%20will%20then%20conduct%20some%20searches%20and%20contact%20you%20to%20discuss%20next%20steps.%0A%0AFYI%20-%20we%20do%20not%20charge%20to%20take%20over%20an%20existing%20portfolio!%0A%0APlease%20provide%20the%20below%20details%20and%20we%20will%20get%20in%20touch%20about%20our%20services%20and%20next%20steps%20to%20adding%20your%20valuable%20trade%20marks%20to%20our%20database%3A%0A%0A1.%20Trade%20Mark%20Owner%20Name%3A%0A%0A2.%20Your%20Full%20Name%3A%0A%0A3.%20Your%20Phone%20Number%3A%0A%0AWe%20look%20forward%20to%20assisting%20you%20with%20your%20trade%20marks.%0A%0AKind%20regards%2C%0AThe%20TradeMark%20Factory%0A1.%20Whether%20you%20have%20an%20Australian%20or%20New%20Zealand%20trade%20mark%20already%3F%0A%0A2.%20If%20yes%2C%20what%20is%20the%20trade%20mark%20number%3F%0A%0A3.%20If%20no%2C%20please%20provide%20us%20with%20a%20list%20of%20the%20countries%20you%20require%20protection%20for%20your%20trade%20mark%3A%20%0A%0A4.%20Please%20provide%20us%20with%20some%20information%20about%20your%20business%20and%20the%20products%20or%20services%20you%20provide%3A%0A%0AOnce%20we%20know%20a%20little%20more%20about%20you%2C%20one%20of%20our%20lawyers%20will%20contact%20you%20to%20discuss%20how%20we%20can%20help.%0A%0AKind%20regards%0AThe%20TradeMark%20Factory","\u003Cp>Get Started\u003C/p>",{"_bookshop_name":38,"title_section":39,"description":40,"note":17},"utils/internationalQuery","\u003Cem>International\u003C/em> Trademark Pricing\n","\u003Cstrong>For\u003C/strong> \u003Cstrong>indicative costs\u003C/strong>, select countries to calculate the estimated price. If you decide to file your international trade marks, \u003Cstrong>contact us\u003C/strong> for a formal fee estimate.","international-trademark-services"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]},"slash":"always"}]}
